  "description": "Jinhong never thought he’d be brave enough to do something like cam work, and he didn’t think he'd ever gain fame as \"BJ Bunny.\" But, as great as a loyal audience is, it makes dating hard. McCain, owner of Funny Fun, had no idea his products were reviewed on stream until he was told to look into it. It was just work…until he realized an order for a local address was identical to one Bunny had just streamed. The chance to meet him is too good to pass up–but will their secrets get in the way? \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\nNote: Includes four extra chapters.",
